<div class="intro"><p>Most moving guides cover the logistics and stop there. But the part that decides how this actually goes — the inner preparation — usually gets none. This planner holds both: the checklists that get you out the door, and the quieter work that helps you arrive whole.</p><p>Tick the checklists as you go, write where it helps, and let the rest stop living in your head. <strong>Everything saves automatically</strong> on this device — your ticks and your writing — and stays private to you. Use <em>Print / Save as PDF</em> to keep a copy, or <em>Download my plan</em> to export it.</p><div class="disclaimer">This planner is an educational, self-reflection resource — not therapy, diagnosis, treatment, or a crisis service. If you’re struggling in a way that feels beyond what a planner can hold, please reach out to someone you trust, a licensed professional, or your local emergency services. You deserve real support.</div></div>

