  <div class="brand"><svg class="mark" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="16" cy="13" r="8.5" fill="#C2674A"/><path d="M5 24h22" stroke="#2F4539" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>The Grounded Expat <span class="c">&middot; The Circle</span></div>
